Build an 8-bit up-counter with asynchronous positive edge triggered areset, synchronous active high enable signal. 
// (1) areset: Resets counter to zero. 
// (2) ena: Enable counting. 
// (3) q: The value of the counter.

module top_module(
    input clk,
    input areset,
