description:
Design a 4x4 switch box that routes four input signals to four outputs based on a 16-bit configuration register. Each output is a logical OR of its respective connections to the inputs, conditioned by the bits in the configuration register. This allows for flexible signal routing depending on the setup of the configuration bits, enabling dynamic connectivity between the inputs and outputs.
module top_module(
    out, 
    in
);

code:
module top_module(
    out, 
    in
);input [3: 0] in ;
    output [3:0] out ;
    reg [15:0] configure ;
    assign out[0] = configure[0]&in[0] | configure[1]&in[1] | configure[2]&in[2] | configure[3]&in[3] ;
    assign out[1] = configure[4]&in[0] | configure[5]&in[1] | configure[6]&in[2] | configure[7]&in[3] ;
    assign out[2] = configure[8]&in[0] | configure[9]&in[1] | configure[10]&in[2] | configure[11]&in[3] ;
    assign out[3] = configure[12]&in[0] | configure[13]&in[1] | configure[14]&in[2] | configure[15]&in[3] ;endmodule

