Design a module that performs a combination of operations involving a 4-bit XOR gate, a 4-bit ripple carry adder, and additional combinational logic. The module outputs a 4-bit sum by XORing the outputs of the XOR gate and the adder. It also provides a carry-out signal from the adder and a separate output that is high if any of its inputs (a, b, or carry-out) are high, effectively functioning as a combinational OR logic block.
module top_module(
  input [3:0] A,
  input [3:0] B,
  output [3:0] out
);

